gaps.how_to_close:
Reclassify every pr-preset as one of:
- a static fit recipe (Motion Scale/Position + Crop by matchName — feasible);
- animation baked inside a MOGRT;
- a prerendered clip;
- a .prfpset shipped for manual drag.
For media: place the photo or QR as a separate clip above or below the MOGRT with a fit recipe, or bake per-episode renders. Prototype the blur margin as a pre-built adjustment-layer item imported from a template .prproj.

gaps.why_it_matters:
Several unverified claims are load-bearing:
- exportAsMotionGraphicsTemplate returns false since 24.x;
- importFile(.aep) returns a FolderItem;
- Responsive Time behaviour on nested comps in AE;
- applyPreset with no selection;
- the importMGT 'overwrites' quirk;
- the 'MOGRT capsule cache';
- the PNG-in-MOV playback claims.
The helpx fixed-issues page cited for the AE 26.3 replaceSource fix returned Access Denied when fetched.

gaps.gap:
Rights and licensing are unresolved for the assets the library would redistribute:
- the SB Sans licence scope for Cloud.ru after leaving Sber in 2022;
- third-party stock SFX loose in podcast (Footage): SoundsCrate whooshes and the SCIMach Micro SFX;
- the AI robot-arm clips showing a third-party-logo-like glyph;
- real people's photos, names, bios, handles and QR codes baked into the webinar and podcast templates.

contradictions:
'pr-preset' deliverables appear in every pack audit:
- titles 'CR Wipe In/Out … Anchor to In Point';
- courses fit, push-in and caption Track Style;
- SMM 'card window';
- webinars 'window fit';
- the podcast frosted-blur adjustment layer with an inverted mask, which 'the plugin inserts'.
The platform research says no ExtendScript or UXP API applies .prfpset; UXP cannot create adjustment layers or masks; keyframes take only LINEAR/BEZIER/HOLD with no influence control.

'Endless' overlay policy:
- courses: a MOGRT comp 3 h long that editors trim;
- SMM: a 10:00 procedural comp with no Responsive Time;
- webinars: a 30-s seamless prerender loop tiled by the panel;
- distribution research: intro + loop + outro clips.

cross_project_patterns:
Auto-width text plate ('плашка') with hand-keyed widths in every pack:
- Titles: dark plates with a 1-frame white leading edge;
- SMM Плашки: #222 bar, lime #CFF500 text;
- Podcast: green tags, callouts, CTA, QR handle and disclaimer bars, plus the light-grey speaker plate;
- Вебинары speaker strips: #222 with white text;
- Курсы subtitle plates: #222;
- Логошоты: white logo and slogan plates.
Shared item: one CR_Plate rig (sourceRectAtTime sampled at rest + padding, edge-anchored Scale-X reveal 0→100, text alpha-matted to the plate, style dropdown, optional leading edge, auto-hide empty lines) plus an ffx.

Text reveal by Range-Selector animators repeats across packs:
- by words inside a plate matte: Titles name, SMM plashki, Podcast callouts and speaker;
- by lines: Titles role line, Курсы cover lines with masks, SMM Заставка masked lines, Podcast CTA with fade;
- word fade-rise: Podcast О_госте.
Shared item: one ffx family CR_TextRise (Words/Lines, offset in em, fade on/off, stagger, in/out) with each pack's curve kept as a named ease.

Stair-step geometry recurs:
- Курсы 'Переход' green stair wipe (6 rects);
- SMM Transition_gray/green/white/with Logo (2 × 5 stepped rects, logo matted to the bars);
- Вебинары stepped PORTAL panel;
- Курсы stepped portal (#333333 or green);
- SMM notched frame overlay.
Shared items: one stepped-geometry module and one CR_Transition family (colour, logo with auto colourway, direction, format) with a CUT marker. Courses and SMM both need the same panel behaviour: 'align the full-cover frame to the edit nearest the playhead'.

Long-form frame overlays, each shipped as huge renders or hand copies:
- Курсы lecture frames: 6 green corner blocks plus windows; 3 × 600-s ProRes = 10 GB;
- SMM notched dark frame: 60-s ProRes, 14.96-s non-seamless period;
- Podcast POD_Frame: grey border, corner tags and frosted blur, copied by hand into 13 comps.
Shared approach: procedural frame templates delivered as still, MOGRT or an exact-period loop; window geometry exported to JSON; 'fit media into window' recipes.

Media windows and slots appear in every pack:
- Вебинары AI window, speaker photo, QR;
- Курсы cover visual, screencast and speaker windows;
- SMM card window;
- Podcast content panel and QR.
Shared convention: a top-level footage layer under an alpha or inverted matte; Media Replacement in the MOGRT; setAlternateSource in AE; in Premiere, a separate clip plus a fit recipe.

Scale hacks instead of native sizes:
- the Titles 'Размер плашек' null at 250 %;
- Podcast built at 720p ×300 %;
- Вебинары text at 206.6 % under a 35 % parent;
- Логошоты text at 100 px @40 % and 30.7 px @130 %;
- SMM 9×16 as a 75 % copy;
- Курсы 4K wrappers at 150 %.
Shared rule: native canvases, real font sizes, text at 100 %.

The same hygiene problems recur in every pack. Candidate: one 'pack doctor' script run on the working copies. Issues:
- legacy ExtendScript expression engine (all 7 projects);
- Advanced 3D on 8 comps (SMM 5, Podcast 3);
- NFD file names (Курсы, SMM, Podcast);
- AppleDouble files, .cfa/.pek caches, Auto-Save copies;
- generic names ('Shape Layer N', 'Pre-comp N', unnamed layers);
- personal or episode content and reference stills baked in;
- audio layers in comps and silent PCM tracks or odd TC in renders;
- mixed 24/25/30 fps;
- off-token near-whites and greys.
